omi","name":"Redmi 12 5G","image":"/images/devices/sky.jpg","downloadUrl":"https://www.pling.com/p/2117984/","codename":"sky","installGuide":null,"changelog":null,"createdAt":"2025-08-24T18:17:40.754Z","updatedAt":"2025-08-24T18:17:40.754Z"},{"id":"cmg88m7vo0000j7787f4ha5kl","brand":"Xiaomi","name":"Redmi 9 Series","image":"/images/devices/04e1726a-7ba6-453e-a9be-ec247fc888d0.jpg","downloadUrl":"https://www.pling.com/p/2323149/","codename":"blossom","installGuide":null,"changelog":null,"createdAt":"2025-10-01T17:05:30.468Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-01T17:05:30.468Z"},{"id":"cmg891jn40001j778fyrrbjx5","brand":"OnePlus","name":"OnePlus 13","image":"/images/devices/b7de64e7-2264-4811-b75f-698a314a187c.jpg","downloadUrl":"#","codename":"dodge","installGuide":null,"changelog":null,"createdAt":"2025-10-01T17:17:25.553Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-01T17:17:25.553Z"},{"id":"cmeq0gkgu0001j7m48mixch5v","brand":"Xiaomi","name":"Redmi K40S","image":"/images/devices/munch.jpg","downloadUrl":"https://www.pling.com/p/1908576/","codename":"munch","installGuide":null,"changelog":null,"createdAt":"2025-08-24T18:17:36.414Z","updatedAt":"2025-12-06T03:49:52.510Z"},{"id":"cmeq0gjzh0000j7m4j3c3sn5h","brand":"Xiaomi","name":"Xiaomi K20 Pro/ Mi 9T Pro","image":"/images/devices/raphael.png","downloadUrl":"https://www.pling.com/p/1499685/","codename":"raphael","installGuide":"# Dynamic Flashing Guide  \n\n---\n\n## Build Info\n\n- **Dynamic GApps build**: Encrypted by default (FBEv2 + casefolding), based on **EROFS** system.\n- **Dynamic Vanilla build**: Encrypted by default (FBEv2 + casefolding), based on **EXT4** system.\n\n---\n\n## 📦 Legacy to Dynamic Flashing (Encrypted)\n\n1. Flash **Recommended OrangeFox dynamic recovery**\n2. Flash **legacy2retrofit zip**\n3. Flash **A11 firmware** (if coming from MIUI or older ROMs)\n4. Flash **ROM**\n5. **Format data**\n6. **Reboot to system**  \n   *(If possible, after the initial setup, go to Recovery and format the data again to avoid issues related to storage permissions.)*\n7. ✅ Enjoy\n\n---\n\n## 🔄 Dirty Flashing from Previous Build\n\n1. Flash **ROM**\n2. Flash **GApps** *(if vanilla build)*\n3. Wipe **dalvik + cache**\n4. **Reboot**\n5. ✅ Enjoy\n\n---\n\n## 🧼 Clean Flashing from Previous Build\n\n1. Flash **ROM**\n2. Flash **GApps** *(if vanilla build)*\n4. Wipe **data + dalvik + cache**\n5. **Reboot**\n6. ✅ Enjoy\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n\n- If your **data partition is on EXT4**, then after formatting data, **change it to F2FS**.\n\n---","changelog":"test","createdAt":"2025-08-24T18:17:35.787Z","updatedAt":"2025-12-06T03:59:49.781Z"}]}